  <!-- ===== ALL PROGRAMMES INCLUDE ===== -->
  <section class="section pricing-includes">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="includes-head">
        <div>
          <h2 class="section-title" data-animate="reveal-up">All programmes include</h2>
          <p class="section-subtitle" data-animate="reveal-up">Everything your child needs, with no extras to pay for.</p>
        </div>
        <img src="/images/mascots/mascot-feeding.webp" alt="" width="400" height="508" class="includes-head__sticker sticker sticker--right" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="includes-grid" data-animate="reveal-up" data-animate-delay="1">
        <div class="includes-item card-lift">
          <span class="icon-circle icon-circle--green" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="includes-icon" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M9 11l3 3L22 4"/><path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h11"/></svg></span>
          <h3>Free Diagnostic Assessment</h3>
          <p>20-minute assessment to identify gaps and recommend the right programme.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="includes-item card-lift">
          <span class="icon-circle icon-circle--pink" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="includes-icon" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"/></svg></span>
          <h3>Monthly Progress Reports</h3>
          <p>Detailed feedback on your child&rsquo;s strengths, areas for improvement, and next steps.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="includes-item card-lift">
          <span class="icon-circle icon-circle--blue" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="includes-icon" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 01-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2z"/></svg></span>
          <h3>WhatsApp Support</h3>
          <p>Your child can send questions between sessions instead of waiting for the next lesson.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="includes-item card-lift">
          <span class="icon-circle icon-circle--gold" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="includes-icon" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 016.5 17H20"/><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 014 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 016.5 2z"/></svg></span>
          <h3>SHARP Method Resources</h3>
          <p>Proprietary notes, practice papers, and model answers &mdash; all included in the fee. See how SHARP works for <a href="/o-level-english/#playbook">English</a>, <a href="/o-level-mathematics/#playbook">Maths</a>, <a href="/h1-general-paper/#playbook">GP</a>, and <a href="/h2-economics/#playbook">Economics</a>.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="includes-item card-lift">
          <span class="icon-circle icon-circle--red" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="includes-icon" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg></span>
          <h3>First-Month Money-Back Guarantee</h3>
          <p>Not satisfied after the first month of lessons? Tell us within 7 days of that month&rsquo;s last lesson and we&rsquo;ll refund the first month&rsquo;s fees in full.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== CTA ===== -->
  <section class="section pricing-cta">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="pricing-cta__inner hero-card" data-animate="reveal-up">
        <h2>Ready to get started?</h2>
        <p>Book a free 20-minute diagnostic assessment &mdash; we&rsquo;ll identify your child&rsquo;s gaps and recommend the right programme.</p>
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-accent pricing-cta__btn">Book Free Assessment</a>
        <p class="pricing-cta__reassure">Month-to-month &middot; no lock-in &middot; first-month money-back guarantee</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== FAQ ===== -->
  <section class="section pricing-faq">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title" data-animate="reveal-up">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="faq-list" data-animate="reveal-up" data-animate-delay="1">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question">How much does tuition cost at A-Worthy?</summary>
          <p class="faq-answer">Group classes of up to 6: O-Level English, O-Level Mathematics and Pre-IB Mathematics are SGD 280/month (Sec 1&ndash;2, Year 3) or SGD 320/month (Sec 3&ndash;4, Year 4); H1 General Paper and H2 Economics are SGD 360/month (JC 1) or SGD 400/month (JC 2). One-to-one coaching is SGD 120/session (O-Level, IB) or SGD 140/session (JC). Every fee includes materials, assessments and WhatsApp support, with no registration fee.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question">Are there any registration or material fees?</summary>
          <p class="faq-answer">No. The monthly fee covers everything &mdash; lesson materials, practice papers, model answers, and access to the resource vault. There are no hidden fees.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item" id="pricing-faq-pay">
          <summary class="faq-question">When and how do I pay?</summary>
          <p class="faq-answer">Fees are a fixed monthly amount, paid in advance by the 1st of each month by PayNow (preferred), bank transfer, or credit card via HitPay. A month with a fifth lesson costs the same. Lessons continue through the school holidays. If your child misses a lesson, you receive the recording. There are no make-up classes. Sec 4 and JC 2 groups end after the national examinations, and no fee is charged for the months after your child&rsquo;s last paper. To stop, give one month&rsquo;s notice.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item" id="pricing-faq-hold">
          <summary class="faq-question">What if my child is away for a few weeks?</summary>
          <p class="faq-answer">Once a year, you can put your child&rsquo;s place on hold for up to four consecutive weeks, for travel or any other reason. Tell us in writing (WhatsApp or email) at least two weeks before the first lesson your child will miss. No fee is charged for the weeks on hold, and your child&rsquo;s place in the group is kept.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question">Is there a lock-in contract?</summary>
          <p class="faq-answer">No. All programmes run month to month. To stop, give one month&rsquo;s notice. There is no other penalty.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question">Why is the fee a range (e.g. SGD 280&ndash;320) instead of a fixed price?</summary>
          <p class="faq-answer">The lower fee is for the foundation years (Sec 1&ndash;2, Year 3, JC 1) and the higher fee for the exam years (Sec 3&ndash;4, Year 4, JC 2), which carry more exam-focused content and practice papers.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question">How does the money-back guarantee work?</summary>
          <p class="faq-answer">If you&rsquo;re not satisfied after the first month of lessons, tell us within 7 days of that month&rsquo;s last lesson and we&rsquo;ll refund the first month&rsquo;s fees in full &mdash; no questions asked.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question">Can I switch between group and 1-to-1 coaching?</summary>
          <p class="faq-answer">Yes. Many students start with group sessions and add occasional 1-to-1 coaching closer to exams. You can mix and match as needed.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question">Are there sibling or multi-subject discounts?</summary>
          <p class="faq-answer">Yes, we offer a 10% sibling discount and a 5% discount for students enrolled in two or more subjects. Contact us for details.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

